{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDE3L011c2UlMjAlMjgyMDE3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Muse","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/vlDFEhlBon98itV43QOPCk7r0I7.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sImtWvw0KTzzlVLASnNQNb3qhTJ.jpg","description":"Samuel Salomon, a literature professor, has been off work for almost a year after the tragic death of his girlfriend. Samuel has been suffering from a recurring nightmare in which a woman is brutally murdered in a strange ritual. Suddenly, the same woman who appears every night in his dreams is found dead in exactly the same circumstances. Samuel sneaks into the crime scene and there he meets Rachel who has also dreamed about the murder. Together, they will do whatever they can to discover the identity of the mystery woman, entering a terrifying world controlled by the figures who have inspired artists throughout time: the Muses.\n\nReleased 9 Nov 2017 · Belgium, France · Language: English · 107 min\nStudio: Frakas Productions, Fantastic Films, Castelao Productions\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2017","genres":["Thriller","Horror","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.8","runtime":"107 min","cast":["Elliot Cowan","Franka Potente","Ana Ularu","Leonor Watling","Manuela Vellés","Joanne Whalley","Christopher Lloyd","Cally O'Connell"],"director":["Jaume Balagueró"],"released":"2017-11-09T00:00:00.000Z","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jaume Balagueró","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/tQgTm3VouDOLovd2M7lITLjqFbx.jpg"},{"name":"Elliot Cowan","character":"Samuel Salomon","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/zxewsfDGYuCqV7gsZjMQct6BXMJ.jpg"},{"name":"Franka Potente","character":"Susan Gilard","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aU6f9UemZsTkqKEG4l77zf6masg.jpg"},{"name":"Ana Ularu","character":"Rachel","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ZIRcuu7SEhZXBUFH8W5Yfe1r27.jpg"},{"name":"Leonor Watling","character":"Lidia Gar